{"seq":3,"slug":"why-gi-hard","title":"为何全局光照困难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/foundations/why-gi-hard","wordCount":1316,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何全局光照困难\">为何全局光照困难</h1><p>离线电影渲染一帧可以等几个小时，游戏只有约 16 毫秒（60 帧）甚至 8 毫秒（120 帧）。同一个物理问题，预算差了六个数量级。全局光照之所以是实时渲染最后被攻克、至今仍未完全攻克的堡垒，不是因为没人知道正确答案——正确答案早在 1986 年就写成了一行方程——而是因为那行方程在实时预算下根本算不完。本文把这道难题拆开，让你明白后面所有近似各自在偷工减料哪一块。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-渲染方程是个递归积分\">核心概念：渲染方程是个递归积分</h2><p>Kajiya 的渲染方程把一个点的出射光写成自发光加上反射积分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_o(p,\\omega_o) = L_e(p,\\omega_o) + \\int_{\\Omega} f_r(p,\\omega_i,\\omega_o)\\, L_i(p,\\omega_i)\\, (\\vec{n}\\cdot\\omega_i)\\, d\\omega_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margi