ss=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>魔鬼藏在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里：点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 收到的入射光 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_i(p,\\omega_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，正是另一个点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 沿那个方向射出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>ω</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_o(q,\\omega_o)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ω</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 出现在了等式两边——它是递归的。展开这层递归，一个点的最终亮度是直接光、一次反弹、两次反弹……无穷级数的和。离线路径追踪用蒙特卡洛随机采样这个无穷积分，每像素打几百上千条光线让噪声收敛；游戏没有这个时间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[渲染方程&lt;br/&gt;Lo = Le + ∫ fr·Li·cosθ] --&gt; B[Li 来自其他点的 Lo]&#10;  B --&gt; C[递归: 解一点需解全场景]&#10;  C --&gt; D{实时无法暴力求解}&#10;  D --&gt; E[降维: 只算漫反射间接光]&#10;  D --&gt; F[缓存: 烘焙 / 探针 预存结果]&#10;  D --&gt; G[近似追踪: 屏幕空间 / 距离场]&#10;  E --&gt; H[实时 GI 方案]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[渲染方程&lt;br/&gt;Lo = Le + ∫ fr·Li·cosθ] --&gt; B[Li 来自其他点的 Lo]\n  B --&gt; C[递归: 解一点需解全场景]\n  C --&gt; D{实时无法暴力求解}\n  D --&gt; E[降维: 只算漫反射间接光]\n  D --&gt; F[缓存: 烘焙 / 探针 预存结果]\n  D --&gt; G[近似追踪: 屏幕空间 / 距离场]\n  E --&gt; H[实时 GI 方案]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"三座大山-积分-递归-可见性\">三座大山：积分、递归、可见性</h2><p>把难度拆成三个相乘的因素，就能看清每种方案在攻哪一座山。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>难点</th>\n<th>本质</th>\n<th>实时近似策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>半球积分</td>\n<td>每点要积分所有入射方向</td>\n<td>球谐/探针压缩、重要性采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归反弹</td>\n<td>解一点依赖解全场景</td>\n<td>截断到 1-2 次反弹、缓存上一帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见性</td>\n<td>任意两点间是否遮挡</td>\n<td>距离场、屏幕空间深度、硬件光追</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>半球积分意味着即使只算一次反弹，每个着色点也要看遍它周围所有表面。递归意味着这些表面的亮度又互相依赖，严格解需要把全场景一起解（这正是离线辐射度算法 radiosity 要解一个巨大线性方程组的原因）。可见性意味着每一对「点—点」之间都要做遮挡测试，而场景里有百万级三角形。三座山任意一座单独都不好爬，相乘起来就是实时 GI 的真正难度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间预算-一切近似的真正约束\">时间预算：一切近似的真正约束</h2><p>理解 GI 的关键，是把它当成一道带硬截止时间的优化题，而非纯物理题。13 毫秒的帧预算里，几何、阴影、后处理、UI 都要分一杯羹，留给 GI 的可能只有 2-3 毫秒。这逼出了三类妥协：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>降维</strong>：只解漫反射间接光（最软、最容易压缩），镜面间接光交给反射探针或屏幕空间反射另算。</li>\n<li><strong>预计算</strong>：把不随时间变的间接光在离线烘进光照贴图，运行时零成本读取——代价是场景与光全静态，详见 <a href=\"../global-illumination/baked-lightmaps\">烘焙光照贴图</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>时间复用</strong>：把昂贵的计算摊到多帧，用上一帧的结果做这一帧的起点（时间累积），代价是动态场景里会有拖影与延迟。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正因为约束是时间，硬件进步会持续改写答案。RTX 系列的硬件光追核让「可见性」这座山从软件遍历变成硬件求交，2026 年的 Lumen、DDGI 才得以把实时一次反弹做进消费级显卡——这条线索贯穿全章，落点见 <a href=\"../global-illumination/realtime-gi\">实时 GI</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性的暴政-为什么-gi-比单帧更难\">一致性的暴政：为什么 GI 比单帧更难</h2><p>还有一层常被忽视的难：时间一致性。即使你能为单独一帧算出可信的 GI，相邻帧之间的微小差异（采样噪声、探针更新、相机移动）会在画面上表现为闪烁、沸腾、拖影——人眼对运动中的不一致比对单帧误差敏感得多。所以实时 GI 不仅要「这一帧大致对」，还要「连续多帧之间稳」。这就是为什么时间抗锯齿（TAA）几乎成了实时 GI 的强制搭档，也是为什么很多 GI 方案宁可牺牲单帧精度去换帧间稳定。这种「宁稳勿准」的取舍，会在性能与美术两章反复出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>渲染方程是递归积分：解一个点需要解全场景，正确答案早有、但实时算不完。</li>\n<li>三座大山——半球积分、递归反弹、点对点可见性——相乘构成 GI 的真实难度。</li>\n<li>实时 GI 本质是带硬截止时间的优化题；2-3 毫秒预算逼出降维、预计算、时间复用三类妥协。</li>\n<li>硬件光追把「可见性」从软件遍历变硬件求交，持续改写实时 GI 的可行边界。</li>\n<li>时间一致性是隐藏难点：帧间不稳的闪烁比单帧误差更刺眼，逼出「宁稳勿准」的设计。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"direct-vs-indirect\">直接与间接光照</a>：本文的递归只发生在间接光那一支。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"lighting-models\">光照模型 BRDF</a>：方程里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是 BRDF。</li>\n<li>同库 <a href=\"../global-illumination/realtime-gi\">实时 GI (Lumen/DDGI)</a>：当代方案如何同时翻越三座山。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/gpu-bottlenecks\">性能优化 · GPU 瓶颈</a>：帧预算从何而来、被谁瓜分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何全局光照困难","id":"为何全局光照困难"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：渲染方程是个递归积分","id":"核心概念-渲染方程是个递归积分"},{"level":2,"text":"三座大山：积分、递归、可见性","id":"三座大山-积分-递归-可见性"},{"level":2,"text":"时间预算：一切近似的真正约束","id":"时间预算-一切近似的真正约束"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性的暴政：为什么 GI 比单帧更难","id":"一致性的暴政-为什么-gi-比单帧更难"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"直接与间接光照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/foundations/direct-vs-indirect"},"next":{"title":"阴影贴图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/shadows/shadow-mapping"}}